  "first_incomplete_prerequisite": "Cross-copy secret exclusion and original-capture 90-day expiry. SQLite source archive is protected, but app-owned conversation history, saved call transcripts/titles, diagnostics and saved conversation summary provide persistence paths around that boundary. Complete this before making automatic sensitive facts eligible.",
  "evidence": [
    "ConversationMemory.capture archives finalized input first, then narrow regex extraction calls MemoryOs.propose; it never automatically accepts.",
    "MemoryModels review states are PENDING/APPROVED/REJECTED/SUPERSEDED; NORMAL/RESTRICTED is not a sensitive-access state. MemoryPolicy rejects RESTRICTED and financial metadata.",
    "SQLiteMemoryStore schema 2 stores source_events with original captured_at_ms/expires_at_ms, opaque fingerprint and text=NULL expiry tombstone; searchExplicitHistory checks current lock both before and after query.",
    "ConversationHistory persists text/contextText/action messages in SharedPreferences with no secret scan or expiry. Missing legacy sourceTimestampMs is replaced with current time, which would renew retention.",
    "SharedPreferencesVoiceCallStore persists transcript text, title, action messages and task-step strings, without privacy filtering or expiry. CoalescingVoiceCallStore can deliver an older queued call snapshot later.",
    "DiagnosticRecorder persists full exact prompts, turn evidence and arbitrary caller strings. restore and snapshot have no expiry or sensitive-lock boundary.",
    "JarvisRuntime initializes all three stores; short-term summary persists separately under ConversationPolicy.SHORT_TERM_SUMMARY_KEY. Its approved-memory observer fences output then writes history cutoff, clears summaries/receipts and advances epoch.",
    "ConversationRuntime already retrieves one approved lexical packet on ordinary turns after raw action routing; limit 8 and character budget 240..1200. Thus every-turn retrieval is partially implemented; semantic retrieval, token accounting and source badge are missing.",
    "LocalModelEngine exposes suspend generate; LiteRtLmEngine owns selected local model and native conversation. No embedding or background extraction runtime exists."
  ],
